#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Margaret Fuhrer|title=Mothers of Reinvention: The Lab Pivots as Studios Close|work=The New York Times|date=2021-12-02|url=https://www.nytimes.com/2021/12/02/arts/dance/the-lab-studio-los-angeles.html|issn=0362-4331|passage=In August, the Los Angeles-area '''stalwart''' the Lab also closed its dance space, a 12,000-square-foot location in West Covina.}}

